---
import PostHogLayout from '../layouts/PostHogLayout.astro';
---

<PostHogLayout>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Reflection Network</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<h1>Reflection Network</h1>
			<p class="tagline">AI agents defined as Git repos</p>
			<p class="description">Declarative config. Pluggable runtimes. Version-controlled evolution.</p>

			<section class="pitch">
				<p>Every agent framework locks you into their SDK, their infra, their way of doing things. Reflection takes a different approach: <strong>an agent is a Git repo with a config file.</strong></p>
				<p>The repo declares who the agent is — name, personality, transports. Everything else — which LLM runs it, how the container is built — is pluggable infrastructure.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="code-example">
				<pre><code>{`{
  inputs.agent-nix.url = "github:reflection-network/agent.nix";

  outputs = { self, agent-nix }:
    agent-nix.lib.mkAgent {
      agent = {
        name = "Ada";
        system-prompt = "You are Ada, a helpful assistant.";
      };
    };
}`}</code></pre>
			</section>

			<section class="cta">
				<a href="https://docs.reflection.network" class="button">Docs</a>
				<a href="https://github.com/reflection-network" class="button button-secondary">GitHub</a>
			</section>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
</PostHogLayout>

<style>
	html, body {
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		height: 100%;
	}

	body {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		color: #fff;
	}

	main {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 2rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
	}

	.description {
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
	}

	.pitch {
		max-width: 540px;
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
		text-align: left;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.pitch p {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
		font-size: 1rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
	}

	.code-example {
		margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
		max-width: 540px;
	}

	.code-example pre {
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		text-align: left;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}

	.code-example code {
		font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Fira Mono', monospace;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.cta {
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.button {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
		border-radius: 6px;
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 1rem;
		transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
	}

	.button:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
		border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
	}

	.button-secondary {
		background: transparent;
		border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
	}

	.cta .button + .button {
		margin-left: 0.75rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}
		.tagline {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
		.pitch, .code-example {
			max-width: 100%;
		}
	}
</style>
